{"book":"hono","chapter":"getting-started","chapterTitle":"مقدمات","slug":"lambda-edge","title":"Lambda@Edge","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"1-الإعداد","text":"1. الإعداد"},{"depth":2,"id":"2-مرحبا-بالعالم","text":"2. مرحبًا بالعالم"},{"depth":2,"id":"3-النشر","text":"3. النشر"},{"depth":2,"id":"الاستدعاء","text":"الاستدعاء"}],"html":"<p><a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/lambda/edge/\">Lambda@Edge</a> هي منصة بدون خادم (serverless) من Amazon Web Services. تتيح لك تشغيل دوال Lambda في مواقع الحافة (edge locations) لـ Amazon CloudFront، مما يمكنك من تخصيص سلوكيات طلبات/استجابات HTTP.</p>\n<p>يدعم Hono منصة Lambda@Edge مع بيئة Node.js 18+.</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-الإعداد\">1. الإعداد</h2>\n<p>عند إنشاء التطبيق على Lambda@Edge،\n<a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/serverless-application-model/latest/developerguide/serverless-cdk.html\"><code>CDK</code></a>\nمفيدة لإعداد الدوال مثل CloudFront و IAM Role و API Gateway وغيرها.</p>\n<p>هيّئ مشروعك باستخدام <code>cdk</code> CLI.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">mkdir</span> my-app\n<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">cd</span> my-app\ncdk init app -l typescript\nnpm i hono @hono/lambda-edge\n<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">mkdir</span> lambda\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">mkdir</span> my-app\n<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">cd</span> my-app\ncdk init app -l typescript\nyarn add hono @hono/lambda-edge\n<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">mkdir</span> lambda\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">mkdir</span> my-app\n<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">cd</span> my-app\ncdk init app -l typescript\npnpm add hono @hono/lambda-edge\n<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">mkdir</span> lambda\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">mkdir</span> my-app\n<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">cd</span> my-app\ncdk init app -l typescript\nbun add hono @hono/lambda-edge\n<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">mkdir</span> lambda\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"2-مرحبا-بالعالم\">2. مرحبًا بالعالم</h2>\n<p>تعديل <code>lambda/index_edge.ts</code>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { handle } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;@hono/lambda-edge&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Hello Hono on Lambda@Edge!&#x27;</span>))\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> handler = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">handle</span>(app)\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"3-النشر\">3. النشر</h2>\n<p>تعديل <code>bin/my-app.ts</code>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">#!/usr/bin/env node</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;source-map-support/register&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> * <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">as</span> cdk <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;aws-cdk-lib&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">MyAppStack</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;../lib/my-app-stack&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> cdk.<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">App</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">MyAppStack</span>(app, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;MyAppStack&#x27;</span>, {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">env</span>: {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">account</span>: process.<span class=\"hljs-property\">env</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">CDK_DEFAULT_ACCOUNT</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">region</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;us-east-1&#x27;</span>,\n  },\n})\n</code></pre>\n<p>تعديل <code>lambda/cdk-stack.ts</code>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Construct</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;constructs&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> * <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">as</span> cdk <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;aws-cdk-lib&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> * <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">as</span> cloudfront <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;aws-cdk-lib/aws-cloudfront&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> * <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">as</span> origins <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;aws-cdk-lib/aws-cloudfront-origins&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> * <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">as</span> lambda <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;aws-cdk-lib/aws-lambda&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">NodejsFunction</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;aws-cdk-lib/aws-lambda-nodejs&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> * <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">as</span> s3 <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;aws-cdk-lib/aws-s3&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">MyAppStack</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">extends</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_ inherited__\">cdk.Stack</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">readonly</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">edgeFn</span>: lambda.<span class=\"hljs-property\">Function</span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">constructor</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">scope</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Construct</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">props</span>?: cdk.<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">StackProps</span></span>) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">super</span>(scope, id, props)\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> edgeFn = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">NodejsFunction</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;edgeViewer&#x27;</span>, {\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">entry</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;lambda/index_edge.ts&#x27;</span>,\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">handler</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;handler&#x27;</span>,\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">runtime</span>: lambda.<span class=\"hljs-property\">Runtime</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">NODEJS_20_X</span>,\n    })\n\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Upload any html</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> originBucket = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> s3.<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Bucket</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;originBucket&#x27;</span>)\n\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> cloudfront.<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Distribution</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Cdn&#x27;</span>, {\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">defaultBehavior</span>: {\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">origin</span>: <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> origins.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">S3Origin</span>(originBucket),\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">edgeLambdas</span>: [\n          {\n            <span class=\"hljs-attr\">functionVersion</span>: edgeFn.<span class=\"hljs-property\">currentVersion</span>,\n            <span class=\"hljs-attr\">eventType</span>: cloudfront.<span class=\"hljs-property\">LambdaEdgeEventType</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">VIEWER_REQUEST</span>,\n          },\n        ],\n      },\n    })\n  }\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p>أخيرًا، شغّل الأمر للنشر:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\">cdk deploy\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"الاستدعاء\">الاستدعاء</h2>\n<p>إذا كنت تريد إضافة المصادقة الأساسية (Basic Auth) ومواصلة معالجة الطلب بعد التحقق، يمكنك استخدام <code>c.env.callback()</code></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { basicAuth } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/basic-auth&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Callback</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CloudFrontRequest</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;@hono/lambda-edge&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { handle } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;@hono/lambda-edge&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Bindings</span> = {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">callback</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Callback</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">request</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CloudFrontRequest</span>\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>&lt;{ <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Bindings</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Bindings</span> }&gt;()\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(\n  <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;*&#x27;</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">basicAuth</span>({\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">username</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">password</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;acoolproject&#x27;</span>,\n  })\n)\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> (c, next) =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">next</span>()\n  c.<span class=\"hljs-property\">env</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">callback</span>(<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>, c.<span class=\"hljs-property\">env</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">request</span>)\n})\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> handler = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">handle</span>(app)\n</code></pre>\n"}